# =============================================================================
# MASES Phase 2 UI — Admin build environment variables
# =============================================================================
#
# File:   mase_app/.env.admin
# Phase:  Admin scaffold (G2.10, step 10 of 10)
# Status: NEW
#
# Vite loads this file when `--mode admin` is passed to `vite build` or
# `vite serve`. The two values below are read by `import.meta.env` at
# build time and inlined into the emitted bundle.
#
# Neither value is a secret. VITE_-prefixed variables are inlined into
# the client bundle at build time and must never carry secret material.
# Both values here are already published: the API origin appears as a
# `<link rel="preconnect">` literal in every entry HTML, and the
# application name appears in every entry HTML's <title>.
#
# The workspace build reads .env.workspace; the portal build reads
# .env.portal. This file is the admin build's counterpart.
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Variables declared by src/vite-env.d.ts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Only two VITE_ variables are declared as required by the ambient
# types (src/vite-env.d.ts v1.1.0):
#
#     VITE_API_BASE_URL   — the MASES Core API origin
#     VITE_APP_NAME       — the product name composed into document.title
#
# A build that omits either fails `vue-tsc --noEmit` before the Vite
# build runs. Do not add a variable to this file unless it is also
# declared in src/vite-env.d.ts in the same change.
#
# =============================================================================

# The MASES Core API origin. Same value as the workspace and portal
# builds — all three deployments talk to the same API. The preconnect
# hint in admin-entry/index.html uses this same literal; if the origin
# ever changes, both must change together.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.maalearna.com.et

# The admin build's application name. Composed into document.title by
# every route wrapper and every page's onMounted hook, separated from
# the page label by an em-dash. The admin dashboard's title reads
# "ዳሽቦርድ — MASES አስተዳደር".
#
# The value is the approved G1 Q2 decision.
VITE_APP_NAME=MASES አስተዳደር